[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15485.83, "timestamp": "04:18:05", "text": "朱尼純一.呃，Juni。呃，11 11:00。 Suyo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15493.309, "timestamp": "04:18:13", "text": "。好的。蘇尤比。那天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15509.309, "timestamp": "04:18:29", "text": "是星期三。  穆約比。等待。隋。等等等等等等。  Moku就是Moku，Moku就是Moku，是這樣嗎？  莫庫莫庫伊。所以 Makuyobi Makui 是星期四。雷丘下週就要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15519.469, "timestamp": "04:18:39", "text": "來了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15529.79, "timestamp": "04:18:49", "text": "所以這是個特例。  Kinoi 就是 Kinoi Kin Kin，這才是真正的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15533.83, "timestamp": "04:18:53", "text": "黃金。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15535.91, "timestamp": "04:18:55", "text": "所以，肯約比肯約比是星期五。好的，我"}]